### 1. Tambah Layanan (POST) - Jalankan ini PERTAMA
POST http://localhost:5000/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "SRV-001",
  "cloth_type": "Cloth",
  "service_name": "Washing",
  "price_per_kilo": 1.00
}

###

### 2. Bikin Pesanan/Order Baru (POST) - Jalankan ini KEDUA
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date_of_pickup": "2026-10-30",
  "total_price": 5.00,
  "amount_paid": 10.00,
  "change_amount": 5.00,
  "cart_items": [
    {
      "service_id": "SRV-001",
      "kilo": 5.0,
      "subtotal": 5.00
    }
  ]
}

### 3. Buat Akun Admin Baru (POST) - Jalankan ini KETIGA
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 4. Test Login Admin (POST) - Jalankan ini KEEMPAT (Setelah akun dibuat)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}